TYPE tau_I

ENTITY I0
QUALIFY I0 type tau_I

ENTITY I1
QUALIFY I1 type tau_I

ENTITY I2
QUALIFY I2 type tau_I

ENTITY I3
QUALIFY I3 type tau_I

POSITION_NEXT I0 I1
POSITION_NEXT I1 I2
POSITION_NEXT I2 I3

ENTITY U1
QUALIFY U1 kind stream
QUALIFY U1 type Stream(tau_V)
AT U1 I0 V1
AT U1 I1 V2
AT U1 I2 V3

ENTITY T1
QUALIFY T1 kind task
QUALIFY T1 context CX1
QUALIFY T1 input U1
QUALIFY T1 available_relation R0
QUALIFY T1 available_relation R1
QUALIFY T1 available_relation R2

UNKNOWN_AT T1 X1 U1 I3 tau_V

CONSTRAINT SAME_RELATION_SUCCESSIVE C1 U1
QUALIFY T1 constraint C1
